# Close one hand part of the way, whatever the hand: closure 0 is the hand group's `open` posture
# in the SRDF, 1 its `closed`, and every joint goes the same fraction of the way between them.
# Planned and executed through MoveIt on <arm>_hand_controller, so the hand must be acquired. A
# robot without hand joints (the 23-DOF G1's rubber hands) refuses the goal.

# "left" or "right".
string arm
# 0 open to 1 closed; outside that range the goal is refused.
float64 closure
# A fraction of the server's speed, above 0 and at most 1; 0 takes the whole.
float64 speed
---
bool success
string message
---
